      "side": 1,
      "message": "Question:\nNow we have \n a. this class.\n b. TestNetworkAgentWrapper in ConnectivityServiceTest\n c. NetworkAgentWrapper in the integration test.\n d. TestableNetworkAgent in libs.\n\n1. It seems to me the first 3 are kind of similar?\nIs it feasible to refactor some of them?\n\n2. Why we need this class while we have (b), can we make the existing ConnectivityServiceTest use this class?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 45,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 45,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "5c398bd36c9974dd1ba01efc88ed681483dd1ba6",
